[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.080]   Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for standing by, and welcome to the Aldera Spera-Pedic
[00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.560]   Second Quarter 2020 Financial Results Conference Call.
[00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:13.040]   At this time, all participants are in a listen only mode.
[00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:16.720]   After the speaker's remarks, there will be a question and answer session.
