[00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:31.320]   If you require further assistance, please press *0.
[00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:35.680]   I would now like to introduce the company's Chief Financial Officer, Mr. Joshua Reedy.
[00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:40.080]   Mr. Joshua Reedy, thank you. You may begin.
[00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.200]   Thank you, and good morning, everyone.
